Output demo.gif

Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 900
Set Height 500
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20

Type "zonasul search 'banana' --limit 5"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "zonasul cart add 33277 --qty 6"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "zonasul cart show --json"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "zonasul delivery windows --limit 5"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
